  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "２ひきの　カメテテが　ひとつの\nいわで　くらす。ケンカすると\nどちらかが　ほかの　いわに　うつる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "2마리의 거북손손이 하나의\n바위에서 산다. 서로 싸우면\n한쪽이 다른 바위로 옮겨 간다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Chaque rocher abrite deux Opermine.\nS’ils se disputent, l’un d’entre eux part à la recherche\nd’un nouveau logis.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Bithora bewohnen jeweils zu zweit einen Felsen.\nEntzweien sie sich im Streit, sucht sich eines\nder beiden einen neuen Felsen als Unterkunft.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Dos Binacle conviven en la misma roca, pero cuando\nse produce un altercado entre ambos, uno de ellos se\nmuda a otra.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "I Binacle vivono su una roccia. Quando litigano, uno\ndei due finisce per spostarsi su una pietra diversa.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Two Binacle live together on one rock.\nWhen they fight, one of them will move\nto a different rock.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "２匹の　カメテテが　ひとつの　岩で\n暮らす。ケンカすると　どちらかが\n他の　岩に　移る。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Dos Binacle conviven en la misma roca, pero cuando\nse produce un altercado entre ambos, uno de ellos se\nmuda a otra.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "からだを　のばす　はんどうで　いわを\nもちあげて　あるく。なみうちぎわで\nながされてきた　かいそうを　たべる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "몸을 늘린 반동으로 바위를\n들어 올리며 걷는다. 물가로\n흘러들어온 해조를 먹는다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ils prennent de l’élan avec tout leur corps et\nsoulèvent ainsi leur pierre pour se déplacer.\nIls mangent les algues échouées sur le rivage.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sie bewegen sich fort, indem sie durch Strecken beider\nExtremitäten ihren Felsen anheben. Sie ernähren\nsich von Seetang, der an die Küste gespült wurde.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "El impulso que cogen al erguirse les permite levantar\nsu roca y caminar. Se alimentan de las algas que la\nmarea arrastra hasta la orilla.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si muovono allungando il corpo a turno, in modo da\nsollevare la pietra. Si nutrono di alghe portate a riva\ndalle onde.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "They stretch and then contract, yanking their\nrocks along with them in bold hops. They eat\nseaweed that washes up on the shoreline.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
