      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "２隻龜腳腳會在海邊找一塊大小\n合適的岩石，附在上面一起生活。\n漲潮的時候會互相合作尋找食物。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ils vivent par groupes de deux sur un rocher\nqui leur convient en bord de mer. À marée haute,\nle duo coopère pour capturer des proies.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Zwei Exemplare hängen sich an einen passenden\nFelsen in Küstennähe, um dort zu leben. Bei Flut\nsammeln sie gemeinsam Nahrung.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Dos Binacle conviven adheridos a una misma\nroca a orillas del mar y colaboran para atrapar\na sus presas cuando sube la marea.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vivono in riva al mare attaccati a due a due su\nrocce adatte. Quando sale la marea, i membri\ndi ciascun duo collaborano per raccogliere cibo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
